00:21:19.000 --> 00:21:22.920
Aku salah dari bintang itu .

00:21:22.920 --> 00:21:24.470
Seluruh rangkaian tragedi ini

00:21:24.470 --> 00:21:27.590
Didn &apos; t spring from Hirumiglas &apos; s mistake or from when I lost control of Taowu;

00:21:27.590 --> 00:21:31.430
